hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1461","Abu Bakr said in the story of Ayyub, on the authority of Ata’, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, “He saw that he did not listen to the women, so he came to them, reminding them and exhorting them.” The two reports are authentic, on the authority of Ata’, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, and on the authority of Ata’, on the authority of Jabir."
